invalid type: string "12. Quick-Reference Glossary \nTerm Plain-English Meaning \nLLM An AI model trained to read a conversation and generate a natural reply, one \nword at a time. Has no memory of its own between separate calls. \nGroq A company providing fast, low-cost hosted access to LLMs via an API, used here \nfor both chat replies and fact extraction. \n". \nTurn 3 â€” \"I am 26 now.\" \nÿÿ